From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gork CI <gork-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Oct 2026 11:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] research-upload-hard-off: port resolver gates to 1.0.45

Upstream 1.0.45 introduced testable Distribution capability gates. Map
Gork's privacy invariant onto that mechanism, keep trace/product telemetry
hard-off regardless of env/config/requirements/remote settings, default repo
change packaging off, and keep feedback available only by explicit local env
opt-in.

Gork-Patch-Id: research-upload-hard-off
Gork-Invariant: research-upload-unreachable
Gork-Risk: critical
---

